  "description": "Nord Piano 5 stage piano: every control of its manual's MIDI controller list.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "Nord Piano 5 User Manual, OS v1.2x, Edition D",
      "notes": "MIDI controller list (page 27 of the PDF) read by tools/profiles/nord/read-nord-cc.mjs from Nord Piano 5 English User Manual v1.2x Edition D.pdf (sha256 52bc70c33c80ce19c15cbde280d58fd3ac908125a16ce5b6a4bc0dcd9121a7b7), https://www.nordkeyboards.com/wt/documents/34/Nord%20Piano%205%20English%20User%20Manual%20v1.2x%20Edition%20D.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/nord/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/nord/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI controller list, with its printed name, sent as the control change it prints on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "The list prints controller numbers only: every value is 0 - 127, and a setting chosen from a list (a model, a waveform, an effect type) is a number here, not a choice.",
    "Left out, the pedals, the wheel and bank select: 0 Bank Select MSB, 32 Bank Select LSB, 64 Sustain, 67 Soft Pedal, 66 Sostenuto, 11 Ctrl Pedal (Expression), 0 Bank Select MSB Program, 6 Bank Select MSB Live, 3 Bank Select MSB Piano, 4 Bank Select MSB Sample."
  ],
  "variables": {
    "channel": 1
  },
